layer. LocalDOSReciprocalSpace[projection][energy, {hLead, hLead12}, hDevice] \
uses the specified device Hamiltonian hDevice. \
LocalDOSReciprocalSpace[projection][energy, {{hLead, hLead12}, {hDevice, \
hDeviceLead}}] uses an independently supplied device Hamiltonian and \
interface coupling. LocalDOSReciprocalSpace[projection][energy, {{hLead, \
hLead12}, {hDevice, hDeviceLead}}, mode] uses the specified surface-Green \
